{"title":"Euclid 2020/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>(a) Suppose that the function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/4/3341342755ffeef7717137278ebfa249ec643e51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x) = 2x - 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"109\" height=\"18\" /> for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and\nthat <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/4/5645d19e56a895262df7c730f69454172cd6836c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g^-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"28\" height=\"15\" /> is the inverse function of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />. Suppose that the function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> satisfies\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/f/79ffecde5dccc207c1e03e845c4e3dcaebca09ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(f(g^-1(x))) = 2x^2 + 16x + 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"247\" height=\"21\" /> for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. What is the value of\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/0/b50140578179cd159963617543879701b33d538f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(\\pi)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"34\" height=\"18\" />?\n(b) Determine all pairs of angles <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/accb77de5cd140f27f8c02226b444b0f5644bbe6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x; y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/2/ec27d4a3bf56da8765058482b0f158e41ccc3d57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\le x &lt; 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"97\" height=\"16\" />  and <span style=\"color:red\">$0 \\le y &lt; 180&#8194;that\nsatisfy the following system of equations:$ (Error compiling LaTeX. Unknown error_msg)</span>log_2(sin x*cos y)<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/b/10b134576d644bfacf81e68b058ac3ab76e0a406.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= -3/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"62\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/a/02a65df49101ae7822d9c24d9f577fae1c85aa8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$log_2(sin x/cosy)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\" /> = 1/2$\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017214915\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.531 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 43/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2462/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:24190:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017214915 and revision id 285374. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}